能依照心情隨時更換視覺上的呈現。<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >多樣的玩法選擇</h2>．生活性與故事性<br>《飛天歷險》擁有完整的生活機制規劃設計，並同時具備豐富的故事架構。在遊戲中，你可以扮演一個名聞遐邇的名人俠士，也可以扮演一名默默無名的市井小民；可以是闖蕩江湖的英雄豪傑，也可以是經營一方的萬元大戶。<br><br>．打怪練功與生產煉化<br>角色的成長是遊戲中不可或缺的一環，在《飛天歷險》中，可以從事各式各樣的職業。擅於戰鬥的職業可透過打怪練功增加經驗值和提升等級，而戰鬥系職業可分為專司主動攻擊和負責補血、輔助攻擊。擅於生產的職業可透過採集和煉化增加金錢收入，生產系職業中亦可分為負責煉化武器、防具及道具與提供原料。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920770/extras/705065c8e52149c9c0b0631efabcc590.poster.avif?t=1723002141\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920770/extras/705065c8e52149c9c0b0631efabcc590.webm?t=1723002141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920770/extras/705065c8e52149c9c0b0631efabcc590.mp4?t=1723002141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920770/extras/22ea9b5b74bbdfaf99a9deef2a7060e6.poster.avif?t=1723002141\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920770/extras/22ea9b5b74bbdfaf99a9deef2a7060e6.webm?t=1723002141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920770/extras/22ea9b5b74bbdfaf99a9deef2a7060e6.mp4?t=1723002141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>．副本挑戰<br>除了打怪練功與生產煉化，亦有各式各樣的大、小型副本可挑戰，你可以當個獨行俠挑戰小型副本，亦可以與公會成員或三五好友組成隊伍一同挑戰大型副本。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920770/extras/943cfba90e128bfbac768308638b70b4.poster.avif?t=1723002141\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920770/extras/943cfba90e128bfbac768308638b70b4.webm?t=1723002141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920770/extras/943cfba90e128bfbac768308638b70b4.mp4?t=1723002141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>．每日活動<br>厭倦了一直打怪的生活嗎？在《飛天歷險》中，每天都有各式各樣的小活動，像是解放雙手的泡溫泉，眼明手快的飛拼不可等，許多趣味小遊戲等著你來參加。<br><br>．個人主義與社群關係<br>在《飛天歷險》中，玩家可以成立公會認識各地英雄豪傑，也可以結成師徒、朋友與戀人等特殊關係；亦可以自立更生、特立獨行，隱性埋名做個獨行俠。", "short_description": "《飛天歷險》是一款經典MMORPG，故事背景發生在「崑崙鏡」所創造的神器世界，由於崑崙鏡世界的秩序失恆，世界的管理者「鏡王」便召喚玩家前來幫忙。獨特的自由轉職系統與天賦搭配，「善」與「惡」主線劇情等，各種特色玩法等著您前來一探究竟！", "supported_languages": "Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920770/header.jpg?t=1723002141", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920770/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1723002141", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920770/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1723002141", "website": "http://domofree.softstar.com.tw/index.aspx", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/ Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i3-8300 / Ryzen 3 2300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GT 1030  / Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Keyboard and mouse are required</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/ Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5-9500 / Ryzen 5 3600 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1660 / Radeon RX 5600 XT